<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90319" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσφιλ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dear, beloved</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἡλίκων . . προσφιλεστάτῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.123
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.40
			</span></i>: c. dat., <i>dear</i> or <i>friendly to . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.163
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				78
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				507e
			</span></i>, etc.: of things, <i>pleasing, agreeable</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργον θεοῖσι π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				580
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολή, χάρις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				224
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), <i><span class="en">
				558
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάσαις ἡλικίαις . . ἡ χρῆσις
				αὐτῆς</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς
				μουσικῆς</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἐστὶ π</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1340a5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἑκάστῳ . . τὸ κατὰ φύσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HA</u>
					590a10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ αἰσθήσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Od.</u>
					45
				</span></i>
			; also of actions, <i>lovely</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Phil.</u>
				4.8
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λῶς</span>
			<i>agreeably</i>, c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				331.9
			</span></i> (Pergam., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, of persons, <i>kindly affectioned, well-disposed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥς μ᾽ ἔθεσθε προσφιλῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					532
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.92
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.86
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λῶς</span>
			<i>kindly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				442
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				822b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἡμῖν ἔχειν</span> to be
				<i>kindly affectioned</i> to us, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.3.44
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. χρῆσθαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.3.16
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Mx.</u>
					248d
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εστάτως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
				</span></i>
			 (s. v.l.) ap.<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.63
			</span></i>: poet. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσφιλέως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					9(1).235
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Larymna</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
